WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:08.970
Hi! I am, he is, they are: when do we use each? Today we'll learn is, am, are, and has and have.

2
00:00:09.120 --> 00:00:12.354
After I, use am: I am happy.

3
00:00:12.504 --> 00:00:17.610
For one person or thing, use is: She is tall. It is red.

4
00:00:17.760 --> 00:00:20.610
You, we, they and plurals use are.

5
00:00:20.760 --> 00:00:24.282
Many cats, so are.

6
00:00:24.432 --> 00:00:27.882
I, you, we and they use have: I have a pen.

7
00:00:28.032 --> 00:00:31.266
He, she and it use has: He has a ball.

8
00:00:31.416 --> 00:00:34.554
One person's name also takes has.

9
00:00:34.704 --> 00:00:40.194
Where we use is, we use has; where we use are, we use have.

10
00:00:40.344 --> 00:00:43.602
Watch out! It's not she have!

11
00:00:43.752 --> 00:00:46.170
He, she and it take has.

12
00:00:46.320 --> 00:00:50.442
So say: She has a doll.

13
00:00:50.592 --> 00:00:58.170
Your turn! I, ___, six. Pause and think.

14
00:00:58.320 --> 00:01:03.162
After I, use am. Did you get it right?

15
00:01:03.312 --> 00:01:11.226
Another one! The sky, ___, blue. Pause and think.

16
00:01:11.376 --> 00:01:16.098
One sky: is. Did you get it right?

17
00:01:16.248 --> 00:01:24.306
Here's another! They, ___, my friends. Pause and think.

18
00:01:24.456 --> 00:01:28.986
They takes are. Did you get it right?

19
00:01:29.136 --> 00:01:37.290
Try one more! He, ___, a red cap. Pause and think.

20
00:01:37.440 --> 00:01:42.066
He takes has. Did you get it right?

21
00:01:42.216 --> 00:01:50.370
Try one more! We, ___, two dogs. Pause and think.

22
00:01:50.520 --> 00:01:55.074
We takes have. Did you get it right?

23
00:01:55.224 --> 00:02:03.402
Try one more! The apples, ___, sweet. Pause and think.

24
00:02:03.552 --> 00:02:08.466
Many apples: are. Did you get it right?

25
00:02:08.616 --> 00:02:17.178
Try one more! My cat, ___, a long tail. Pause and think.

26
00:02:17.328 --> 00:02:22.362
One cat: has. Did you get it right?

27
00:02:22.512 --> 00:02:30.786
Try one more! You, ___, my best friend. Pause and think.

28
00:02:30.936 --> 00:02:35.441
You takes are. Did you get it right?

29
00:02:35.591 --> 00:02:43.505
Last one! I, ___, a new bag. Pause and think.

30
00:02:43.655 --> 00:02:48.185
I takes have. Did you get it right?

31
00:02:48.335 --> 00:02:56.081
Remember: I am. One person or thing takes is and has. You, we, they and plurals take are and have.

32
00:02:56.231 --> 00:03:00.641
Tell us about yourself with I am and I have!

